  "details": "The rpc package is a Windows dropper. RpcParse decrypts the bytes it is given, writes them as RpcUpdater.dll under LocalAppData\\GoRpc, adds an HKCU Run key and starts the DLL with rundll32. RpcQuery, whose output RpcParse expects, turns TLS verification off, and rpc.txt in the module names https://meowrpc.info:8080/rpc. Read at v0.1.3; earlier versions were not read.",
